{%- comment -%}
  snippets/quick-view-modal.liquid
  Empty modal shell (ported from the demo's .modal[data-quick-view-modal]).
  assets/theme.js fetches the target product's live JSON from Shopify's
  native `/products/{handle}.js` endpoint (Product JSON) and renders the
  modal__panel markup client-side from that response, so quick view always
  reflects real, current product/variant data without a second full page
  render.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="modal" data-quick-view-modal></div>
